msgid "MediaTek HNAT not detected; a load attempt is made after saving."
msgstr "未检测到 MediaTek HNAT；保存后将尝试加载。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/turboacc.js
msgid "MediaTek HNAT (PPE + WED + HNAT) is hardware forwarding that bypasses the CPU; recommended as the primary engine."
msgstr "MediaTek HNAT（PPE + WED + HNAT）是绕过 CPU 的硬件转发，建议作为主引擎。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/turboacc.js
msgid "MediaTek HNAT specific settings."
msgstr "MediaTek HNAT 专用设置。"

