msgstr "当前固件不含 SFE 连接管理器模块；无法加载时会被跳过，不影响网络。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/turboacc.js
msgid "Toggles the MediaTek HNAT hook; the kernel switch is written by the turboacc service after Save & Apply."
msgstr "切换 MediaTek HNAT 钩子；内核开关由 turboacc 服务在保存并应用后写入。"

